{"title": "[情報] 尼克多位助教在頒發儀式只拿到戒指空盒", "author": "Wojnarowski (@wojespn)", "board": "", "date": "Fri Oct 23 11:39:50 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1792726793.A.3E0.html", "body": "The Knicks' assistant coaches did not receive their championship rings during\nTuesday's ceremony, despite being handed ring boxes, according to league sourc\nes.\n\nMany longtime employees at Madison Square Garden will not receive rings at all\n, per team sources.\n\nThose employees got their hopes up in late September, when they were sent a fa\nke championship ring offer as part of a phishing test.\n\nhttps://x.com/theathletic/status/2113455120692195588\n\n據聯盟消息人士透露，尼克的多位助理教練在週二的冠軍戒指頒發儀式上，儘管拿到了戒\n指盒，卻沒有真正收到冠軍戒指。\n\n另外，根據球隊內部人士的說法，MSG有許多資深員工甚至根本不會獲得冠軍戒指。\n\n這些員工原本在9月下旬燃起了希望，當時他們收到了一封假冒的冠軍戒指提供通知，而\n這其實是公司進行的網路釣魚測試。\n\nKnicks sent a \"phishing email\" disguised as a championship ring offer to Madis\non Square Garden employees.\n\nThose that clicked the fake link were forced to attend a mandatory cybersecuri\nty class to \"help satisfy some of [James] Dolan's cybersecurity concerns.\"\n\n(via @joevardon)\n\nhttps://x.com/underdognba/status/2113457250773668272\n\n尼克向MSG的員工寄送了一封網路釣魚電子郵件，假裝是在提供冠軍戒指。\n\n凡是點擊了假連結的員工，都被要求強制參加網路安全課程。此舉是為了滿足James Dola\nn對網路安全的某些疑慮\n\n短評或心得：\n\n釣魚測試..", "comments": [{"tag": "推", "user": "holyhelm", "content": "荀彧表示:", "time": "10/23 11:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "hanslins", "content": "這啥？？？？", "time": "10/23 11:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "oa0416", "content": "乾，資安真搞，這樣也要釣魚", "time": "10/23 11:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "benson1212", "content": "不發就算了 還發信釣魚 好好笑", "time": "10/23 11:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "KhePri", "content": "這是哪種社會實驗？？？", "time": "10/23 11:41"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "blackboard", "content": "我急著拿去賣  你框我", "time": "10/23 11:41"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "loverxa", "content": "又摳又搞 助教算球隊地位蠻高了吧", "time": "10/23 11:42"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "shulado", "content": "杜蘭這麼小氣?", "time": "10/23 11:42"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "hanslins", "content": 